WEBVTT

00:00.740 --> 00:04.160
Andika vigawo tasa vya 75.

00:04.160 --> 00:07.390
Andika jibu lako kwa kutumia mtindo wa vipeo

00:07.390 --> 00:08.970
Hapa tuna maneno ya kuyazingatia kwa makini

00:08.970 --> 00:12.410
Vigawo tasa, na hili neno mtindo wa vipeo.

00:12.410 --> 00:15.460
Tutashughulika na hili neno mtindo wa vipeo baadae.

00:15.460 --> 00:18.560
Kitu cha kwanza kukiangalia kwa makini hapa ni

00:18.560 --> 00:19.380
nini namba tasa?

00:19.380 --> 00:22.240
Kama marudio, namba tasa ni namba

00:22.240 --> 00:26.130
ambayo inagawanyika kwa yenyewe na moja tu, na mifano

00:26.130 --> 00:28.880
ya namba tasa--ngoja niandike

00:28.880 --> 00:31.030
namba tasa hapa

00:34.760 --> 00:36.840
Kwahiyo 2 ni namba tasa.

00:36.840 --> 00:39.850
Inagawanyika kwa 1 na 2.

00:39.850 --> 00:42.490
3 ni namba tasa nyingine.

00:42.490 --> 00:46.790
Sasa, 4 sio namba tasa kwasababu

00:46.790 --> 00:49.790
inagawanyika kwa 1, 2, na 4.

00:49.790 --> 00:50.580
Tunaweza kuendelea.

00:50.580 --> 00:56.220
5, sawa, 5 inagawanyika kwa 1 na 5, kwahiyo 5 ni tasa.

00:56.220 --> 00:59.920
6 sio tasa, kwasababu inagawnyik kwa 2 na 3.

00:59.920 --> 01:01.590
Nadhani unaelewa kinachofanyika hapa

01:01.590 --> 01:04.160
Unahamisha 7, 7 ni tasa.

01:04.160 --> 01:06.470
Inagawanyika kwa 1 na 7.

01:06.470 --> 01:08.220
8 sio tasa.

01:08.220 --> 01:11.440
kwa 9 unaweza kushawishika kusema ni tasa, lakini kumbuka

01:11.440 --> 01:15.420
inagawanyika kwa 3, kwa hiyo 9 sio tasa.

01:15.420 --> 01:18.970
Tasa si sawa na namba witiri.

01:18.970 --> 01:21.400
Namba 10, 10 sio namba tasa

01:21.400 --> 01:23.560
inagawanyika kwa 2 na 5

01:23.560 --> 01:27.220
11 inagawanyika kwa 1 na 11, kwahiyo 11

01:27.220 --> 01:28.240
ni namba tasa

01:28.240 --> 01:29.780
tunaweza kuendelea hivi.

01:29.780 --> 01:31.570
Wataalamu wametengeneza programu za kompyuta

01:31.570 --> 01:33.260
kwa ajili ya kutafuta vigawo tasa vyote namba.

01:33.260 --> 01:35.220
Kwahiyo, sasa tunajua ni nini tasa, tasa

01:35.220 --> 01:39.240
kigawo tasa ni kuivunja vunja namba mfano 75, kwenye

01:39.240 --> 01:41.620
zao la namba tasa.

01:41.620 --> 01:43.180
Hebu tufanye hii.

01:43.180 --> 01:45.530
Tutaanza na 75, na nitaifanya

01:45.530 --> 01:49.080
kwa kutumia mti wa vigawo.

01:49.080 --> 01:51.750
Kwanza tunatafuta namba tasa ndogo kabisa ambayo

01:51.750 --> 01:53.890
itaingia kwenye 75.

01:53.890 --> 01:55.430
Namba tasa ndogo kabisa ni 2.

01:55.430 --> 01:57.390
Je, 2 inaingia kwenye 75?

01:57.390 --> 02:00.705
Sawa, 75 ni namba witiri, au namba iliyo kwenye mamoja

02:00.705 --> 02:02.280
ambayo ni 5, ni namba witiri.

02:02.280 --> 02:06.580
5 haigawanyiki kwa 2, kwahiyo 2 haitaingia kwenye 75.

02:06.580 --> 02:08.090
Tujaribu 3.

02:08.090 --> 02:09.639
Je, 3 inaingia kwenye 75?

02:09.639 --> 02:12.440
Ndio, 7 jumlisha 5 ni 12.

02:12.440 --> 02:15.480
12 inagawanyika kwa 3, kwahiyo 3 itaingia kwenye hiyo namba.

02:15.480 --> 02:20.440
Kwahiyo 75 ni 3 mara kitu fulani

02:20.440 --> 02:22.990
Kama umewahi kufanya hesabu za kubadili,unajua kama

02:22.990 --> 02:25.890
unazo robo tatu, una senti 75 au kama una 3

02:25.890 --> 02:28.930
m,ara 25, unapata 75.

02:28.930 --> 02:31.560
Kwahiyo hii ni 3 mara 25.

02:31.560 --> 02:33.720
Unaweza kuzidisha mwenyewe kama huamini.

02:33.720 --> 02:35.960
Zidisha 3 mara 25.

02:35.960 --> 02:40.470
Je, 25 inagawanyika kwa--unaweza kuachana na 2.

02:40.470 --> 02:44.910
Kama 75 haikugawanyika kwa 2, 25 haitagawanyika

02:44.910 --> 02:46.000
kwa 2 pia.

02:46.000 --> 02:48.730
Lakini labda 25 inagawanyika kwa 3 tena.

02:48.730 --> 02:52.290
Kama ukichukua tarakimu 2 jumlisha 5, unapata 7.

02:52.290 --> 02:57.700
7 haigawanyiki kwa 3, kwahiyo 25 haitagawanyika kwa 3.

02:57.700 --> 02:59.480
Tunaendelea kwenye namba nyingine: 5

02:59.480 --> 03:01.430
Je, 25 inagawanyika kwa 5?

03:01.430 --> 03:01.980
Ndiyo, sawa kabisa.

03:01.980 --> 03:03.590
Ni 5 mara 5.

03:03.590 --> 03:08.330
Kwahiyo 25 ni 5 mara 5.

03:08.330 --> 03:11.730
Tumemalizakutafuta vigawo tasa kwasababu

03:11.730 --> 03:13.390
tayari tumeshapata vigawo tasa vyote.

03:13.390 --> 03:18.270
Kwahiyo tunaweza kuandika kwamba 75 ni 3 mara 5 mara 5.

03:18.270 --> 03:25.640
Kwahiyo 75 ni sawa na 3 mara 5 mara 5.

03:25.640 --> 03:27.350
Tunaweza kusema ni 3 mara 25.

03:27.350 --> 03:29.400
25 ni 5 mara 5.

03:29.400 --> 03:33.370
3 mara 25, 25 ni 5 mara 5.

03:33.370 --> 03:36.460
Kwahiyo hivi ni vigawo tasa, lakini tunatakiwa

03:36.460 --> 03:41.690
kuandika jibu letu kwenye mtindo wa vipeo.

03:41.690 --> 03:44.560
Hii ina maana kwamba, kama tumerudia tasa, tunaweza kuandika

03:44.560 --> 03:45.920
vigawo hivyo kama vipeo.

03:45.920 --> 03:48.480
Kwahiyo ni nini 5 mara 5?

03:48.480 --> 03:52.380
5 mara 5 ni 5 imezidishwa kwa yenyewe mara mbili.

03:52.380 --> 03:56.310
Hii ni sawa na kuandika 5 kwa kipeo cha pili

03:56.310 --> 03:58.380
Kwahiyo kama tunataka kuandika jibu letu kwa kutumia mtindo wa kipeo

03:58.380 --> 04:03.420
tunaweza kusema hii ni sawa na 3 mara 5

04:03.420 --> 04:08.110
kwa kipeo cha pili, ambayo ni kitu kile kile kama 5 mara 5.
